    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The chromosome names in your GTF file is like <i>chr10</i>, but the chromosome names in your BAM file are like <i>Amillepora08292-RA.</i><div><br></div><div>I see that your GTF file has a tag in the extra info column named &quot;ID&quot;, and its value is something like &quot;Amillepora16770-RA&quot;. However, featureCounts need to have the chromosome names in the GTF file (the first column) match the chromosome names in your BAM files (the 3rd column).</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
